                %mrow
                  %mn 2
                  %mi Vect
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2Vect
            denotes some version of the category of 2-vector spaces with the property that the category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
